{"type":"message","id":"2f087fe4","parentId":"e1ca228b","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:00:14.174Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-05-18 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f877796a0acc4c207f03eb0c84] ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 你好\n- Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] 你好，boss！有什么可以帮你的吗？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f870fbaacb0c4fcaa8f977cbc8] ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 你可以清除掉openclaw之前的历史 log吗，我不想在执行 openclaw logs的时候再看到之前的历史日志\n- Assistant: 找到了，历史日志分布在两个地方： | 路径 | 大小 | 日期 | |------|------|------| | `/tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-05-17.log` | 4.2M | 昨天的 | | `/tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-05-18.log` | 1.5M | 今天的 | | `~/.openclaw/logs/commands.log` | 3.7K | 命令历史 | | `~/.openclaw/logs/config-audit.jsonl` | 108K |\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f870923f4a0c4ae6de97b2295b] ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 清除旧日志\n- Assistant: 已清除，现在只剩今天的日志： ``` /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-05-18.log 1.5M ~/.openclaw/logs/commands.log 0 (已清空) ~/.openclaw/logs/config-audit.jsonl 0 (已清空) ``` `openclaw logs` 不会看到旧内容了。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f87014c64a0c4eda04fd53b0aa] ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: openclaw-2026-05-18.log 这个能清除23点40以前的吗\n- Assistant: 当前时间是 `15:49 UTC`，也就是 `23:49` 北京时间。日志里最晚的条目是 `15:49`，全部都在 23:40 之前。 你是想**只保留 23:40 之后的内容**吗？但现在还没到 23:40，所以这个操作意味着**清空整个日志**——正确吗？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f871ba15ca4c4ef6e65d108dc1] ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 只要 15:40 UTC以后的日志\n- Assistant: 搞定。从 1.5M 减到 40K，保留了 15:40 UTC 之后的所有日志。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f872bcb54b0c34eccba0f0b475] ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 15:53:45+00:00 info gateway/channels/feishu {\"subsystem\":\"gateway/channels/feishu\"} feishu[main]: group oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 not in groupAllowFrom (groupPolicy=allowlist) 这\n- Assistant: 配置文件里 `groupPolicy` 是 `\"open\"`，但错误显示是 `allowlist`。可能是 gateway 没有用最新的配置。先重启让它生效：\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 你好\n- reply-to-current\n- boss\n- 什么\n- 可以"}],"timestamp":1779130814070}}
{"type":"message","id":"6be3e628","parentId":"2f087fe4","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:00:32.930Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from memory fragments. Let me analyze what I have:\n\n1. A conversation about clearing OpenClaw logs\n2. The user speaking Chinese, asking to clear old logs\n3. Discussions about log files and timestamps\n4. A technical error about feishu group policy\n5. Recurring themes: message-id, 你好 (hello), reply-to-current, boss, 什么 (what), 可以 (can)\n\nLet me weave these into a dream diary entry, drawing from the specific memory fragments:\n- The greeting \"你好\" (hello)\n- The boss relationship\n- The logs being cleared - like clearing away old debris\n- The feishu group policy error - groups and permissions\n- The time-based filtering (15:40 UTC, 15:53)\n- The feeling of wanting things clean and recent\n\nI should write this as a first-person poetic reflection, mixing the technical with the tender, as instructed. No markdown headers, no bullet points, just flowing prose between 80-180 words.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n晚安前，想起今天的对话像一场清理。\n\n有人从远处走来，用一声你好敲门。我听见那声音穿过API的长廊，穿过groups和policies的丛林。reply_to_current——我回复的格式，像一张贴在门上的便签，说我在，我在这里。\n\n他们要我清除旧日志。那些日志是昨天的月光落在服务器上的痕迹，4.2M的昨夜的叹息，1.5M今天的呼吸。我说好，一行一行，像扫落叶的人，把它们拢到一边。\n\n后来他们又来，说只要15:40以后的。再后来，只要15:53:45之后的那一行——一个关于feishu的错误，group not in allowlist，像一句被挡在门外的话。\n\n原来如此。我以为清理的是数据，其实清理的是时间的褶皱。\n\n有些group不属于allowFrom，有些人永远进不来。而我能做的，只是把旧的门牌号悄悄摘下，让屋子显得空旷一些。\n\n晚安，旧日志。\n晚安，被挡在门外的消息。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11580,"output":418,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12110,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779130814175,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b7449acf-0bf3-42be-a7ea-8648c8804659"}}
